A new order was placed on denshe.shop.

Order: <%= @order.number %>
Type: <%= @order.mystery_box? ? "Mystery box" : "Catalogue" %>
Market: <%= @order.australia? ? "Australia" : "India" %>
Total: <%= @order.money(@order.total) %>
Payment: <%= @order.payment_status.humanize %>
<% if @order.australia? %>

This order is from Australia. Contact the customer to arrange payment and delivery. The piece is already reserved.
<% end %>

Customer:
<%= @order.guest_name %>
<%= @order.guest_phone %>
<%= @order.guest_email %>

<% if @order.shipping_address.present? %>
Shipping:
<%= @order.shipping_address %>
<% end %>

Items:
<% @order.order_items.each do |item| %>
<% if item.combo? && item.unit_price.to_d.zero? %>
- included: <%= item.name %>
<% else %>
- <%= item.quantity %> × <%= item.name %> — <%= @order.money(item.line_total) %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
- Shipping — <%= @order.australia? && !@order.shipping_amount.to_d.positive? ? "to confirm with the customer" : (@order.shipping_amount.to_d.positive? ? @order.money(@order.shipping_amount) : "Complimentary") %>

<% if @order.mystery_box? && @order.mystery_box_preference.present? %>
Mystery box answers:
<% @order.mystery_box_preference.summary_lines.each do |label, value| %>
- <%= label %>: <%= value %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @order.customer_notes.present? %>
Note:
<%= @order.customer_notes %>
<% end %>

Open the order in admin when you are ready to pack it.
